{
  "dom_id": "step-e3157",
  "name": "Example: Using Trigonometry to Find an Angle in the Coordinate Plane",
  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14216822/assets/f0347081906740a955f8a192baa53c65536b110df9adc6021288c43767c9ac2f.png)\n\nGiven that the point $A$ has coordinates $(\\sqrt 3, 1),$ calculate the angle $\\theta.$",
  "worked_solution": "First, we can form a triangle by creating a vertical line from $A$ to the $x$-axis.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14216822/assets/3e5ebde9ee4132e0bd64cb2aaf2a3763abc2b0de1a798e87ed4ee652ca360078.png)\n\nUsing the tangent ratio, we have\n\n$$\n\\tan\\theta = \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt 3} = \\dfrac{\\sqrt 3}{3}.\n$$\n\nFinally, using the inverse tangent, we get\n\n$$\n\\theta = \\arctan{\\left( \\dfrac{\\sqrt 3}{3} \\right)} = 30^\\circ.\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e3157\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Using Trigonometry to Find an Angle in the Coordinate Plane</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e3157\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n     